sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant Component as Component.razor
    participant Client as Resilient Typed HttpClient
    participant BFF as BFF Cookie Verification
    participant Handler as Minimal API Feature Handler
    participant Service as Application Service
    participant Storage as Table Storage Execution
    User->>Component: Tap command or submit form
    Component->>Client: Send source-generated DTO
    Client->>BFF: Same-origin request with credentials
    BFF->>BFF: Authenticate PoWatch.Auth cookie
    alt anonymous on protected API
        BFF-->>Client: 401 or redirect gate
        Client-->>Component: Show login path
    else authenticated
        BFF->>Handler: Dispatch to vertical slice endpoint
        Handler->>Handler: Validate route, query, and feature gates
        Handler->>Service: Execute use case
        Service->>Storage: Query or upsert entities
        Storage-->>Service: Durable result
        Service-->>Handler: DTO or domain result
        Handler-->>Client: JSON or file response
        Client-->>Component: Update state
        Component-->>User: Render refreshed UI
    end
